---
description: Select a dedicated GAD bounded inspector or managed VCS read.
args:
  request: RuntimeTraceInput
returns: TraceNext
---
Managed-source log requests use inspect-vcs. Broken durable integrity needs inspect-integrity next. A publication question whose original coordinates do not match needs inspect-publication. Otherwise, if the current bounded result answers the assigned question, report it. Without that evidence use inspect-turn, inspect-invocation, inspect-publication, inspect-roster or inspect-storage for those subjects. For channel history use bounded-channel-read. For already observed healthy channel state report integrity and activity independently.
